    "body": "While `TOOLBOX_PATH` is set in every toolbx container, it does not hold information important for this particular module. It is a path to the internal Toolbx binary used for container initialization. Instead I'd look for the file `/run/.toolboxenv`. It's presence signifies that the container is in fact a toolbx container.",
